== Personal life ==
Graham was married to Terry Lee Boggs until 2003; they have a daughter.<ref name="kids">{{cite news |title=Lindsey Graham's Sister's Very Intriguing Donation Revealed |date=July 21, 2026 |website=[[The Daily Beast]] |url=https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/articles/lindsey-graham-sister-very-intriguing-232132774.html |access-date=August 31, 2026 |via=[[Yahoo News]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |title=For the record: Divorce decrees |newspaper=[[Anderson Independent-Mail]] |date=November 24, 2003 |page=5B |edition=Upstate |url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/anderson-independent-mail/201840405/ |via=[[Newspapers.com]] |access-date=August 31, 2026}}</ref> Graham married Larry Nordone circa 2006;<ref name="The State marriage">{{Cite news |url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/the-state-marriage-licenses-lexington/202012537/ |title=Marriage Licenses, Lexington County |date=May 25, 2006 |newspaper=The State |page=8 |via=[[Newspapers.com]] |access-date=July 20, 2026}}{{Open access}}</ref> they also have a daughter.<ref name="kids"/> They live in [[Lexington, South Carolina]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.yahoo.com/politics/lindsey-graham-announces-presidential-candidacy-120466235491.html |title=Lindsey Graham announces presidential candidacy, highlighting his personal story |first=Jon |last=Ward |date=June 1, 2015 |access-date=July 13, 2026 |website=[[Yahoo.com]] |archive-date=March 5, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160305052402/https://www.yahoo.com/politics/lindsey-graham-announces-presidential-candidacy-120466235491.html |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="NYTimes Bond" />

